<title>广州汽车购新补贴再升级！</title>
<link>http://weixin.sogou.com/weixin?type=2&amp;query=%E5%8D%97%E9%83%BD%E5%91%A8%E5%88%8A+%E5%B9%BF%E5%B7%9E%E6%B1%BD%E8%BD%A6%E8%B4%AD%E6%96%B0%E8%A1%A5%E8%B4%B4%E5%86%8D%E5%8D%87%E7%BA%A7%EF%BC%81</link>
<content:encoded>&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;rich_media_content&quot; id=&quot;js_content&quot;&gt;&lt;section&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;图片&quot; class=&quot;rich_pages wxw-img&quot; src=&quot;http://img2.jintiankansha.me/get?src=http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/V9V83VFzia0RxiaK3eOWibdaTQbp9fz5bxLDOr9LRl0nibN9wB40ATibG6h7ibntXCn3U5UfmdF9BNYJX3ECFf8QLgUg/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;amp;from=appmsg&amp;amp;tp=webp&amp;amp;wxfrom=5&amp;amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=0&quot; /&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;section&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;图片&quot; class=&quot;rich_pages wxw-img&quot; src=&quot;http://img2.jintiankansha.me/get?src=http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/V9V83VFzia0TzpazRHiaUD7qgPRVzxlbeibBdAHnT67xfibKV4l0BOR747iaKqLa4zKnLI8Vp7ymUUGm2onwZV7xiaWA/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;amp;tp=webp&amp;amp;wxfrom=5&amp;amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=1&quot; /&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;section&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;本文自南都·湾财社。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;section&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span&gt;采写 | &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;南都N视频记者廖艳萍 通讯员穗商务宣&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;section&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span&gt;编辑 | 柴华 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin: 10px 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 31px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 26px; color: rgb(33, 34, 36);&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 16px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(33, 34, 36); text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; font-size: 19px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 1px;&quot;&gt;2026年“广东优品购”广州市促进汽车消费活动自5月1日开展以来，已累计惠及近6万消费者。为进一步激发市场活力，加快推动汽车消费智能化、绿色化转型，广州汽车购新补贴迎来新一轮升级。自8月14日10时起，将正式启用全市统一活动入口，再次投入亿元补贴，以更便捷的申领流程持续点燃市民购车热情。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;section&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;图片&quot; class=&quot;rich_pages wxw-img&quot; src=&quot;http://img2.jintiankansha.me/get?src=http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/N4IOFu6gHFYYRahczBD30MLBpNt2wKdQ5viam7pRqIMESDPpOyFeP4PxsmF7B1ItOE4oxrKjlSTaa0NVfcZ10ticIYEJ2Z76p8tIiccoWhuxyY/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;amp;from=appmsg&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; padding: 0px; height: 3535.52px !important; vertical-align: bottom; width: 608px; display: inline;&quot; title=&quot;imagefile&quot; /&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;section&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;图片&quot; class=&quot;rich_pages wxw-img&quot; src=&quot;http://img2.jintiankansha.me/get?src=http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/N4IOFu6gHFYlnicV9QFo6icfLNFxSVCH3r0JP2ibDfaKhlPacyw901NFicrJELFX6bWibDRtc8cJgxSd1rxJw5CNSEX5M5pZ5IjUb9SlgutwWN3o/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;amp;from=appmsg&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; padding: 0px; height: 1542.8px !important; vertical-align: bottom; width: 608px; display: inline;&quot; title=&quot;imagefile&quot; /&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;section&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;图片&quot; class=&quot;rich_pages wxw-img&quot; src=&quot;http://img2.jintiankansha.me/get?src=http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/N4IOFu6gHFbXn4TktfE4YeEAt7wZSqTEKASicibfd7FCvtd8qBFTvf4sH7CzE5ocvs4kIsiaaz4PtcFM58QPiatQf0yBs4m6C7mHuYo1fOfTQE8/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;amp;from=appmsg&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; padding: 0px; height: 3761.24px !important; vertical-align: bottom; width: 608px; display: inline;&quot; title=&quot;imagefile&quot; /&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;section&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;图片&quot; class=&quot;rich_pages wxw-img&quot; src=&quot;http://img2.jintiankansha.me/get?src=http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/N4IOFu6gHFZWVK3me8XQFjGhQjuLZbc3FFgu7owM5mYpziaib3zBEPu5kUIYYNbzK0eQ7vLSKszeRNgqVkJhjiatP7PU55tYALlrMVMDgDqSDU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;amp;from=appmsg&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; padding: 0px; height: 2496.6px !important; vertical-align: bottom; width: 608px; display: inline;&quot; title=&quot;imagefile&quot; /&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(141, 141, 141); text-align: justify; line-height: 31px; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;section&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span&gt;END&l